WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.912
King Wu Ding of Shang truly wanted to govern his country better.

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:08.174
He hoped to find a worthy man who could help him.

00:00:08.524 --> 00:00:12.556
Legend says that one night, Wu Ding dreamed of a worthy man.

00:00:12.906 --> 00:00:17.586
When he woke, he carefully remembered what the worthy man looked like.

00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:22.496
Wu Ding sent people everywhere to search for the man in his dream.

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:27.310
After a long search, they finally found a clue at a construction site.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:32.004
Fu Yue was originally a wall builder, and his craftsmanship was excellent.

00:00:32.354 --> 00:00:36.914
Wu Ding welcomed him in person and asked him to take an important office.

00:00:37.264 --> 00:00:43.264
Fu Yue helped Wu Ding manage state affairs and offered many suggestions.

00:00:43.614 --> 00:00:48.438
Working together, they made the Shang dynasty stronger.

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:52.220
Wu Ding is a Shang king recorded in the oracle-bone inscriptions.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:58.042
The tale of seeking a worthy man in a dream is a beautiful legend passed down by later generations.

